hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"656","[AI-translation] Abu Kabash se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main Madina me chhe mahine ki bakri laya aur nuqsan uthaya. To main Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aaya aur unhen woh bataya. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Aath ya nau mahine ki bakri qurbani ke liye behtareen hai.'"
"657","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Kurz (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko aqeeqe ke bare mein farmate suna: 'Ladke ke liye do bakriyan, aur ladki ke liye ek bakri. Tumhen koi parwah nahin ke woh nar hon ya mada.'"
"658","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Kurz (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se aqeeqe ke bare mein poocha. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Ladke ke liye do bakriyan; aur ladki ke liye ek bakri. Aur tumhen koi parwah nahin ke woh (bakriyan) nar hon ya mada.'"
"659","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Bani Kurz Ka'bain (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko aqeeqe ke bare mein farmate suna: 'Ladke ke liye do barabar (mushabeh) bakriyan, aur ladki ke liye ek bakri.'"
"660","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Kurz (Raziyallahu anha) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Ladke ke liye do aqeeqe (do janwar) aur ladki ke liye ek aqeeqa.'"
"661","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Yazid (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ek din ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath the, ke Aap ko pani ka bartan pesh kiya gaya. To Aap ne us mein se piya, phir hukm diya ke unhen diya jae, to unhon ne piya. Woh bartan tamam hazireen mein ghumaya gaya. Hazireen mein se ek ne kaha: Beshak main rozedar hun. Un mein se ek shakhs ne kaha: Woh har din roza rakhta hai aur kabhi nahin kholta. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo hamesha roza rakhe, (shariat mein) us ne na roza rakha na khola.'"
